{
  "comment": [
    "Catalog.parse fixtures. Paths are relative to fixtures/firmware/. Each case resolves a catalog via file, edits applied to base (default catalogs/base.json), or generate. expect.error is the exact message both sides give, or \"*\" where only rejection is shared (serde's own wording)."
